<section class="bw-hero">
  <picture>
    <source media="(max-width: 700px)" srcset="{{ 'living-960.webp' | asset_url }}">
    <img class="bw-hero__image" src="{{ 'living-1600.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="Warm, sunlit living room with natural textures and considered furniture" width="1600" height="1067" fetchpriority="high">
  </picture>
  <div class="bw-hero__shade"></div>
  <div class="bw-hero__content">
    <p class="eyebrow">CONSIDERED DESIGN. EVERYDAY LIVING.</p>
    <h1>A slower kind<br>of <em>living.</em></h1>
    <p class="bw-hero__description">Objects with purpose. Spaces with soul.<br>Furniture that feels like coming home.</p>
    <a class="bw-button bw-button--light" href="{{ routes.all_products_collection_url }}">Explore the collection</a>
  </div>
  <div class="bw-hero__bottom"><span>Made to belong. Built to stay.</span><span>FOR ROOMS THAT ARE LIVED IN.</span><span>01 — THE ART OF HOME</span></div>
</section>

<section class="bw-intro bw-shell">
  <p class="eyebrow">LESS, BUT MORE MEANINGFUL</p>
  <h2>Good design doesn’t shout.<br>It makes you <em>feel something.</em></h2>
  <p>Natural materials. Thoughtful proportions. A quiet attention to detail.<br>We believe the things you live with should only get better with time.</p>
</section>

<section id="collections" class="bw-collection bw-shell">
  <div class="bw-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">THE CONSIDERED COLLECTION</p><h2>Your everyday, <em>elevated.</em></h2></div><a class="bw-text-link" href="{{ routes.all_products_collection_url }}">Discover all pieces</a></div>
  <div class="product-grid">
    {% for product in collections.all.products limit: 3 %}
      {% render 'product-card', product: product %}
    {% else %}
      <p class="bw-empty">Add Bouldwood products in Shopify to populate this collection.</p>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>

<section id="story" class="bw-story bw-shell">
  <div class="bw-story__image"><img src="{{ 'living-960.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="Soft neutrals, wood and natural light in a thoughtfully furnished home" width="960" height="1200" loading="lazy"><span>A LITTLE CLOSER TO NATURE.</span></div>
  <div class="bw-story__copy"><p class="eyebrow">THE BOULDWOOD PHILOSOPHY</p><h2>Not just a piece.<br><em>A part of your life.</em></h2><p>The morning coffee. The long conversations. The Sunday with nowhere to be. We design for the moments that make a house your home.</p><p>Honest materials and enduring forms, chosen with intention. Because the most beautiful spaces are the ones that feel like you.</p><a class="bw-text-link" href="{{ routes.all_products_collection_url }}">Find your piece</a></div>
</section>

<section id="details" class="bw-values bw-shell">
  <div><span>MATERIAL</span><h3>Honest by nature.</h3><p>Rich timber, tactile textiles, and finishes you’ll want to reach out and touch.</p></div>
  <div><span>FORM</span><h3>Room to breathe.</h3><p>Considered silhouettes that bring balance to the spaces you call your own.</p></div>
  <div><span>EVERYDAY</span><h3>Made for living.</h3><p>Comfort and character in equal measure. Pieces for all of life’s little rituals.</p></div>
</section>

<section class="bw-closing"><p class="eyebrow">MAKE ROOM FOR WHAT MATTERS</p><h2>Your home.<br><em>Your kind of beautiful.</em></h2><a class="bw-button bw-button--light" href="{{ routes.all_products_collection_url }}">Find something to come home to</a></section>
{% schema %}{"name":"Bouldwood home","settings":[],"presets":[{"name":"Bouldwood home"}]}{% endschema %}